  'chat.flow.lead': 'Rapport Crypto Chat combines three layers: <strong>blockchain identity</strong> (your wallet), <strong>relay signaling</strong> (discovery and invites) and a <strong>direct WebRTC channel</strong> (where messages actually travel, always encrypted).',
  'chat.step1.title': '<span class="who">You</span> create your identity',
  'chat.step1.desc': 'On first use, the app generates a BIP39 seed and derives an EVM wallet — which becomes your unique chat identifier — plus payment addresses (Bitcoin Taproot/SegWit and other families). You can also import an existing EVM private key or recovery phrase.',
