  'chat.step3.title': '<span class="who">You</span> invite via wallet',
  'chat.step3.desc': 'Knowing only the recipient\'s wallet, you start the conversation: a <code>chat_request</code> lands in their inbox and the message stays pending until accepted. Nothing is decrypted or transmitted without consent.',
