  'chat.step5.desc': 'Each message is encrypted locally with <strong>X25519 + ChaCha20-Poly1305</strong> before leaving the device — with nonce, sequence and anti-replay timestamp — and is only decrypted on the authorized device.',
  'chat.step6.title': 'History stays in your pocket',
  'chat.step6.desc': 'Conversations, contacts, tokens and network settings live in a local database on the device (encrypted SQLite). No server backup, no cloud profile.',
