  // Escrow page
  'escrow.meta.title': 'Escrow — Guaranteed payment | Rapport Crypto Chat',
  'escrow.meta.desc': 'Send crypto safely with arbitrated escrow: the payer picks a trusted arbitrator, the receiver can add a second one, and funds are only released after approval. Transparent, traceable and on-chain.',
  'escrow.meta.ogDesc': 'Crypto payments protected by arbitration: arbitrators chosen by the parties, mandatory approval after the receiver\'s readiness, a deadline with automatic refund and an audit trail in chat.',
  'escrow.hero.title': 'Guaranteed payment with Escrow',
  'escrow.hero.tagline': 'Send crypto with the protection of an arbitrator chosen by you — funds stay custodied in a smart contract and are only released with approval.',
  'escrow.hero.subtagline': 'Transparent: every step appears in the chat of everyone involved. Traceable: every decision is an on-chain transaction.',
  'escrow.hero.badge': 'On-chain arbitrated escrow',
  'escrow.what.title': 'What escrow is',
  'escrow.what.lead': 'Escrow is a payment <strong>with neutral custody</strong>: instead of sending straight to the receiver, the amount stays locked in a smart contract (<code>EscrowVault</code>) until an <strong>arbitrator</strong> — a third party chosen by both sides — confirms the payment should be released. If nothing works out, the amount goes back to the payer.',
  'escrow.role.payer.title': 'Payer',
  'escrow.role.payer.desc': 'The sender. Issues <code>/escrow</code>, picks the first arbitrator and deposits the funds in the contract.',
  'escrow.role.recv.title': 'Receiver',
  'escrow.role.recv.desc': 'The recipient. Can accept 1 arbitrator or invite a second from their own contacts. Marks <em>ready to receive</em> before any approval.',
  'escrow.role.arb.title': 'Arbitrator(s)',
  'escrow.role.arb.desc': 'Trusted contacts who judge the payment. With 2 arbitrators, <strong>both</strong> must approve. Each receives an invite in chat and must accept the role.',
  'escrow.role.mgr.title': 'App manager',
  'escrow.role.mgr.desc': 'Maintains the contract infrastructure. Receives a 0.50% fee per settled escrow and is notified when a network has no support yet.',
  'escrow.steps.title': 'How it works — step by step',
  'escrow.s1.title': '<span class="who">Payer</span> starts the escrow',
  'escrow.s1.desc': 'In the chat with the receiver, types <code>/escrow &lt;amount&gt; &lt;coin&gt;, &lt;network&gt;, &lt;days&gt;</code> — e.g. <code>/escrow 100 POL, Polygon PoS, 7</code>. The deadline in days is required (max. 365).',
  'escrow.s2.title': '<span class="who">Payer</span> picks the arbitrator',
  'escrow.s2.desc': 'A contact list opens, <strong>sorted by those most used as arbitrators</strong>. The chosen one receives an invite in their own chat.',
  'escrow.s3.title': '<span class="who">Arbitrator</span> accepts or declines',
  'escrow.s3.desc': 'Holding the invite message, the contact accepts or declines to arbitrate. If declined, the flow stops and the payer picks someone else.',
  'escrow.s4.title': '<span class="who">Receiver</span> decides: 1 or 2 arbitrators',
  'escrow.s4.desc': 'Can accept the single arbitrator <strong>or</strong> invite a second arbitrator from their own contacts — who must also accept the invite.',
  'escrow.s5.title': '<span class="who">Payer</span> deposits the funds',
  'escrow.s5.desc': 'With the arbitrators accepted, the app executes <code>createEscrow</code> on-chain: the amount leaves the payer\'s wallet and stays custodied in the contract.',
  'escrow.s6.title': '<span class="who">Receiver</span> signals readiness',
  'escrow.s6.desc': 'When ready to receive, they tap the escrow message (or use <code>/escrow done</code>) and confirm. <strong>Payer and arbitrators get the alert</strong> that the decision is unlocked.',
  'escrow.s7.title': '<span class="who">Arbitrators</span> approve or reject',
  'escrow.s7.desc': 'Each arbitrator holds the message and chooses <strong>Approve</strong> or <strong>Reject</strong>. With 2 arbitrators, both approvals are required.',
  'escrow.s8.title': 'Automatic settlement',
  'escrow.s8.desc': '<strong>Approved:</strong> the receiver gets the net amount; manager and arbitrators get their fees. <strong>Rejected or deadline expired:</strong> the payer is refunded minus the fees.',
  'escrow.callout.fraud': '<strong>Anti-fraud:</strong> the contract <strong>does not accept approvals before the receiver marks readiness</strong>. No arbitrator can anticipate a decision — approval only exists after the signal from whoever will receive.',
  'escrow.callout.refund': '<strong>Deadline with refund:</strong> if the day count expires without a decision, any participant executes <code>refundExpired</code> and the payer recovers the funds — nothing stays locked forever.',
  'escrow.fees.title': 'Fees',
  'escrow.fees.lead': 'Charged on the custodied amount at settlement time:',
